  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Closure of old KLIMA engagements 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KLIMA wishes to engage a consultant to help close old engagements in the unit and review annual accounts in GRAM. Currently KLIMA has 103 engagements which are past end date and need to be closed. In addition, approximately 180 annual accounts will need to be reviewed in GRAM in 2025 and a number of engagements related to these accounts will subsequently also have to be closed. In order not to create an even larger backlog it is crucial to reduce the number of open old engagements and to ensure that annual accounts are reviewed in GRAM in due time. A consultant would be able to help us achieve that</narrative>
  </description>
